Sales Analysis Report
This project presents an interactive **Sales Analysis Report** built using **Power BI**. The report provides meaningful insights into key sales metrics to support data-driven decision making.
Key Features:
Total sales by **region**, **state**, and **product category**
Monthly sales trends and seasonal patterns
Top-performing sub-categories and regions
Dynamic filters for **year**, **region**, and **customer segments**
KPI cards highlighting **total sales**, **average sales per order**, and more
Data Used:
Sample sales dataset including fields such as:
Order Date
Sales Amount
Product Category/Sub-category
Region & State
Customer Segment
Tools & Technologies:
Power BI Desktop** for dashboard development
DAX** for calculated columns and measures
Custom formatting and slicers for interactivity
Purpose:
To visualize and explore sales performance metrics that help businesses identify trends, opportunities, and areas for improvement.
